ga9r(){return"--- PLATFORMS & LANGUAGES ---\n\u2022 Mobile: Android (Kotlin/Java) \xb7 iOS (Swift)\n\u2022 Multi-platform: Flutter (Dart) \xb7 KMP (Kotlin Multiplatform)\n\u2022 Declarative UI: Jetpack Compose \xb7 SwiftUI \xb7 Compose Multiplatform (CMP)\n\n--- AGENTIC IDEs & AI ---\n\u2022 Agentic IDEs: Cursor \xb7 Google Antigravity \xb7 OpenAI Codex \xb7 Claude Code (incl. CLI)\n\u2022 AI & APIs: AI Agents \xb7 OpenAPI \xb7 ChatGPT \xb7 Claude (Anthropic) \xb7 Google Gemini \xb7 GitHub Copilot \xb7 MCP \xb7 LLM Integration\n\n--- DOMAINS & EXPERIENCE ---\n\u2022 Mobile Security & Banking \xb7 SDK Development \xb7 Android NDK \xb7 OCR \xb7 Liveness \xb7 BLE \xb7 Telematics \xb7 IoT \xb7 White-label Apps \xb7 Ads at Scale\n\n--- ARCHITECTURE & TOOLS ---\n\u2022 Clean Architecture \xb7 MVVM \xb7 SOLID \xb7 Scrum \xb7 Kanban \xb7 CI/CD \xb7 Git \xb7 GitHub \xb7 GitLab \xb7 Azure DevOps \xb7 Bitbucket \xb7 Technical Writing"},
